     ", using spatial graph distance. The default coordinate is ", 
     Cell[BoxData[FormBox[RowBox[{SubscriptBox["x", "i"], "(", "v", ")", "=", 
          "min", "{", SubscriptBox["s", "i"], "(", "w", ")", ":", "w", 
