  Cell[TextData[{"Select a coordinate to inspect its fiber. The explorer uses \
an oblique planar layout of the base, with fibers arranged above their base \
points. The projection labels remain integer triples; the drawing \
coefficients are not coordinates assigned by the construction. The pictures \
are computed before the selector, so the saved notebook opens with the \
geometry already visible."}], "Text"], 
